</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Доработка обработки «Формирование начислений НДФЛ» 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype">    Change Request
</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                <span class=" jira-issue-status-lozenge aui-lozenge jira-issue-status-lozenge-yellow jira-issue-status-lozenge-indeterminate aui-lozenge-subtle jira-issue-status-lozenge-max-width-medium" data-tooltip="&lt;span class=&quot;jira-issue-status-tooltip-title&quot;&gt;BA in progress&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;jira-issue-status-tooltip-desc&quot;&gt;Business Analysis or functional design is in progress&lt;/span&gt;">BA in progress</span>    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">           High
    </td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Chmykhalov, Aleksey
    </td>
