</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Номинальная стоимость цб при формировании отчетности 0420459
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype">    Task
</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                <span class=" jira-issue-status-lozenge aui-lozenge jira-issue-status-lozenge-green jira-issue-status-lozenge-done aui-lozenge-subtle jira-issue-status-lozenge-max-width-medium" data-tooltip="&lt;span class=&quot;jira-issue-status-tooltip-title&quot;&gt;Cancelled&lt;/span&gt;">Cancelled</span>    </td>
