</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="ACCOUNTING-15667" href="https://jira/browse/ACCOUNTING-15667">ACCOUNTING-15667</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ускорение запроса на получение остатков по ММ + ускорение восстановление последовательности по ММ сделкам 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype">    Task
</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                <span class=" jira-issue-status-lozenge aui-lozenge jira-issue-status-lozenge-green jira-issue-status-lozenge-done aui-lozenge-subtle jira-issue-status-lozenge-max-width-medium" data-tooltip="&lt;span class=&quot;jira-issue-status-tooltip-title&quot;&gt;Cancelled&lt;/span&gt;">Cancelled</span>    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">           High
    </td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Done
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Chmykhalov, Aleksey
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Saveliev, Maxim
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Saveliev, Maxim
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Feb/25 11:47 +0300 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 13/May/26 19:12 +0300 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Apr/25 10:34 +0300 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        1C-InvestmentCentre            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">864000</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">599400</td>
                                            <td class="timespent">264600</td>
